        <section id="hypervisors" class="card">
            <h2>Virtual Machines &amp; Multi-Tenant Hypervisors</h2>
            <p>Virtual Machines emulate distinct physical computer architectures using dedicated software layer called hypervisors. Type-1 (Bare-Metal) hypervisors deploy directly onto the server hardware to provide clean, isolated resource division across tenant environments with maximum performance.</p>
