        <!-- CONCLUSION -->
        <section id="strategic-conclusion" class="card">
            <h2>Strategic System Outlook &amp; Conclusion</h2>
            <p>Cloud Computing networks require moving away from outdated perimeter-based models toward continuous, integrated zero-trust security strategies. As distributed architectures transition to complex containerized environments and microservice layers, security controls must be embedded directly within the system design code itself.</p>
            <p>Long-term operational resilience depends heavily on how effectively an organization manages its configurations within the Shared Responsibility framework. By coupling automated compliance scanners with real-time SOC monitoring, cloud systems can successfully detect, isolate, and neutralize advanced threats before they impact critical business data layers.</p>
