        <section id="security-measurement" class="card">
            <h2>Cloud Security Measurement of Daily Use Components</h2>
            <p>Modern consumers and infrastructure operations interact with hyperscale web clouds daily. Measuring security enforcement across these platforms relies on specialized evaluation parameters to verify application safety benchmarks:</p>
            
